OL,3,GNEWSA'Vital' phone box broken in
OL,4,Avillage with no signal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "lifeline" phone box in a village
OL,7,Fwith no mobile phone signal has been
OL,8,Fleft damaged, leading to worries about
OL,9,Fhow people might get help in an
OL,10,Femergency.
OL,12,FMilldale, on the
OL,13,FStaffordshire-Derbyshire border, is a
OL,14,Fhub for walkers, and its idyllic
OL,15,Fsurroundings means it attracts lots of
OL,16,Fvisitors in the summer.
OL,18,FIt is cut-off from modern
OL,19,Fcommunication, however, as the area's
OL,20,Fgeography has left it without mobile
OL,21,Fphone reception, meaning landlines are
OL,22,Fheavily relied upon.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
