OL,3,GNEWSA'Vital' phone box broken in
OL,4,Avillage with no signal
OL,5,
OL,6,F"They've basically smashed the receiver
OL,7,Fto smithereens," said local resident
OL,8,FBecky Garner, speaking about the
OL,9,Fvandalism.
